# Ghost AI - Master Project Context



## 1. The Elevator Pitch 

We built Ghost AI—an autonomous AI proxy that turns natural language and voice dictation into scheduled errands, bookings, and completed purchases. Unlike standard chatbots, Ghost AI parses messy user requests, curates options through a stateful multi-turn scenario engine, and executes the final transaction using the PayPal Sandbox API. Packaged in a premium, Apple-inspired glassmorphism UI, it allows users to handle real-world logistics frictionlessly.



## 2. The Tech Stack 

- Frontend: React (Vite) for a high-performance, animated chat interface.

- Backend: Python (FastAPI) for high-speed REST API routes and Server-Sent Events (SSE).

- Voice Engine: Web Speech API for native browser dictation.

- Payment Gateway: PayPal Developer REST API (Orders/Checkout integration).

- Architecture Design: Decoupled frontend/backend with real-time payment status polling and CORS management.



